From: mpv-ht development <dev@mpv-ht.local>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 00:30:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] gpu-next: expose cell sizing and translucent guide parameters

Accept integer physical cell pitches from one through eight pixels.
Expose guide width, opacity and color for live Lua-controlled presentation.
Retain two-pixel cells and one-pixel, 70% guides as native fallback defaults.
Cache a separate coverage mask; color-map guides before compositing.
Keep source measurements, configurable backing opacity and OSD colors.

